        <span>Konsultasi & Penawaran Resmi</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">
        Siap Mengoptimalkan Pendingin Ruangan Anda?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Pilih kebutuhan <strong>Jual AC Baru dan Bekas</strong>, <strong>Sewa AC</strong>, <strong>Jasa Service AC</strong>, <strong>Jasa Pasang AC</strong>, atau <strong>Jasa Cuci AC</strong> ke keranjang RFQ atau hubungi tim ACNesia via WhatsApp.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-open-rfq
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3.5 px-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-normal shadow-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer select-none"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Buka Keranjang Penawaran (RFQ)</span>
